"featured.asap-rocky-don-t-be-dumb-world-tour-79c44b4e.body":"Athens gave the world democracy, tragedy and comedy, then waited two and a half thousand years for the best-dressed man in it to arrive.",
"featured.bob-dylan-e603e5ab.body":"Rumour has it nobody knows the setlist — not the band, possibly not him. That has been the arrangement for sixty years, and Oslo will take it.",
"featured.bulent-ersoy-3c8f59c8.body":"Protocol note, Antwerp: when the Diva enters, you stand. There is no second item of protocol.",
"featured.erykah-badu-imeho-an-intimate-experience-with-er-72034c1e.body":"WARNING: prolonged exposure may cause revised life plans, incense purchases and lasting distrust of your own record collection. Milan accepts no liability.",
"featured.fat-freddy-s-drop-aab2b830.body":"Shipping forecast: seven New Zealanders adrift on horns and dub, drifting inland towards landlocked Zurich. Sea state smooth. Set length oceanic.",
"featured.hatsune-miku-miku-expo-2026-europe-ee092c17.body":"Support ticket #01: performer does not physically exist. Status: closed — working as intended. Sixteen years on stage, no body, no bad nights.",
"featured.j-cole-the-fall-off-tour-50cb5d66.body":"Actuarial note, Zurich: a tour named The Fall-Off, headlined by a man with no recorded misses. Risk of decline assessed at negligible.",
"featured.kneecap-b0a59635.body":"Performed in a language certain governments would prefer stayed untranslated. Stockholm gets the full glossary: three lads, one balaclava, zero apologies.",
"featured.my-chemical-romance-0ffb66fd.body":"Reports of this band's death (2013) were accurate at the time. The séance now fills stadiums. Wear black — it is what they would have wanted, and they said so.",
"featured.pitbull-i-m-back-d99dad7f.body":"Press release: Mr. Worldwide returns to the world, which, technically, he never left. He does not specify where he went. He never explains. Dale.",
"featured.placebo-30th-anniversary-tour-cbbd436f.body":"Thirty years of trials confirm this Placebo outperforms the real thing. Side effects include eyeliner and your entire adolescence returning at once.",
"featured.power-slap-25-hitman-vs-dumpling-2-c0942257.body":"The sequel the arthouse crowd was afraid to ask for: Hitman versus Dumpling, part two. One plot device, delivered open-palm. Cannes remains silent.",
"featured.slava-s-snowshow-50438278.body":"Incident report, Guadalajara: indoor blizzard, cause — one clown. The storm is scheduled, the tears are voluntary, the paper snow gets everywhere for weeks.",
"featured.tarkan-d5b28834.body":"Diplomatic cable, Abu Dhabi: the şıkıdım arrives by moonlight. Three decades of field evidence suggest resistance is purely decorative.",
"featured.the-blaze-dj-set-5628863c.body":"Postcard from İzmir: the French duo that makes grown men cry in slow motion, with the Aegean just past the decks. Wish you were sweating.",
"featured.the-strokes-reality-awaits-92a28ab5.body":"A voicemail from 2001, finally delivered. They still sound like New York at 2am, and reality, as promised on the tin, is still waiting.",
"featured.the-weeknd-after-hours-til-dawn-tour-16b72e5f.body":"The one tour we were legally obliged to hang first: it runs from after hours til dawn, and we have never related to anything more.",
"featured.two-door-cinema-club-b7be0302.body":"Minutes of the press conference: the cat on the poster has been fully briefed and offers no comment. Monterrey will dance anyway. The crown stays on.",
"featured.tyla-the-a-pop-world-tour-3da81ac5.body":"Forecast for Düsseldorf: thirty degrees indoors, a pop front moving in from Johannesburg, visibility zero past the third row. Umbrellas useless.",
"featured.verka-serduchka-and-band-fcdabbbf.body":"Customs declaration, Hamburg: one silver star hat, seven costume changes, one Eurovision grudge from 2007 kept in working order. Nothing further.",
